%%{init: {"flowchart": {"diagramPadding": 40, "rankSpacing": 30}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Open[Backend opens PR by ID] --> Fetch[Fetch comments, thread state, and user drafts]
    Fetch -->|No new remote content| Cached[Keep cached PR view and local drafts]
    Fetch -->|Remote comments, changes, or open drafts| Pull[Import remote entries by forge ID]
    Pull --> Reconcile[Keep unsent local drafts and reconcile state]
    Cached --> Ready[Return PR review to client]
    Reconcile --> Ready
    Fetch -->|Read fails or drafts unavailable| Stale[Mark stale and block publish]
